@rally_against_socialism
title: Rally against socialism
subtitle: Organize a rally denouncing socialism.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; socialism -= 2*(1 - dissent); industrialist_dissent -= 10

We must rid Germany of the socialist plague infecting it. The industrialists approve of our actions.


@against_SPD_KPD
title: Against the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span> and the <span style="color: #8B0000;">**KPD**</span>
subtitle: We can disrupt their motions in the Reichstag and their rallies.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; spd_relation -= 10*(1-dissent); workers_spd -= 1*(1-dissent), industrialist_dissent -= 10; dnvp_relation += 10*(1-dissent)

Scholz, as chairman of our Reichstag delegation, condemns the <span style="color: #E3000F;">**SPD**</span>'s policies, while we organize counter-rallies to the marxists'.


@against_toleration
title: Against toleration
